    "title": "Inside Cover - Elijah Muhammad's Signature & Ownership",
    "image": "001.jpeg",
    "translationMaulana": "This is the personal Quran of the Honorable Elijah Muhammad, the Messenger of Allah to the Lost-Found Nation of Islam in the West. His signature at 6116 S. Michigan Ave., Chicago, Illinois, establishes undeniable ownership and direct use of this sacred Islamic text by the leader of the Nation of Islam.",
    "translationYusuf": "The handwritten signature and address of Elijah Muhammad authenticate this as his personal copy of the First Quran given to him by Master Fard Muhammad. This manuscript represents the spiritual foundation upon which the Nation of Islam was built and the guidance the Honorable Elijah Muhammad followed in his ministry to Black America.",
    "transliteration": "Elijah Mohammed, 6116 S. Michigan Ave., Chicago, Illinois",
    "annotations": "Authentication & Provenance: This inside front cover bears the handwritten signature of the Honorable Elijah Muhammad in his own hand, establishing irrefutable ownership. The address, 6116 S. Michigan Ave., Chicago, is historically verified as his residence from 1934 onward during the Nation of Islam's most formative and expansive period. This manuscript represents the spiritual authority and guidance that Elijah Muhammad relied upon in his teachings to the Nation.",
    "context": ""
  },
